--- Comment #4 from Stefan S <aentfs-Mmb7MZpHnFY@public.gmane.org> ---
I have this problem on a Geforce GTX 660 (NVE6, GK106), too. This problem only
occures when desktop effects are turned on in KDE SC. Therefore I think this
problem is 3d related or maybe drm. Steam (32bit) is sometimes at fault, too. 

Sometimes befor the grafics are unresponsive, some parts of the grafical ui
only show flicering white an black rectangles. And sometimes the computer (or
perhaps only grafics) become very slow.

After a lockup, I can sometimes use my keyboard to issue commands. Sometimes my
computer is complete unresponsive.

I use archlinux (x86_64) with the newest Nouveau releases and this bug existes
as long as I use Nouveau. (3-4 month)

